*> vybe-test: cobol/binary_comp_types/binary_comp3_remainder
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_binary_comp_types.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 D PIC 9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 17.
01 Q PIC 9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 R PIC 9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DIVIDE 5 INTO D GIVING Q REMAINDER R.
    DISPLAY Q.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING Q DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "3"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [3] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY R.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING R DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "2"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [2] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

